#: kmanagesieve/session.cpp:117
msgid "Cannot use TLS since the underlying Qt library does not support it."
msgstr ""
"Non é posíbel empregar TLS porque a biblioteca de Qt subxacente non o admite."

#: kmanagesieve/session.cpp:123
msgid ""
"TLS encryption was requested, but your Sieve server does not advertise TLS "
"in its capabilities.\n"
"You can choose to try to initiate TLS negotiations nonetheless, or cancel "
"the operation."
msgstr ""
"Solicitouse cifrado TLS mais semella que o servidor de Sieve non anuncia TLS "
"entre as súas capacidades.\n"
"Pode escoller iniciar as negociacións de TLS mesmo así ou cancelar a "
"operación."

#: kmanagesieve/session.cpp:125
msgid "Server Does Not Advertise TLS"
msgstr "O servidor non anuncia TLS"

#: kmanagesieve/session.cpp:125
msgid "&Start TLS nonetheless"
msgstr "&Iniciar TLS aínda así"

#: kmanagesieve/session.cpp:127
msgid "TLS encryption requested, but not supported by server."
msgstr "Solicitouse cifrado TLS, que o servidor non admite."

#: kmanagesieve/session.cpp:168
msgid ""
"The server does not seem to support TLS. Disable TLS if you want to connect "
"without encryption."
msgstr ""
"Semella que o servidor non admite TLS. Desactive TLS se desexa conectarse "
"sen cifrado."

#: kmanagesieve/session.cpp:277
msgid "Sieve Authentication Details"
msgstr "Detalles de autenticación de Sieve"

#: kmanagesieve/session.cpp:278
msgid ""
"Please enter your authentication details for your sieve account (usually the "
"same as your email password):"
msgstr ""
"Introduza os seus detalles de autenticación para a súa conta de sieve "
"(normalmente os mesmos que o contrasinal de correo electrónico):"

#: kmanagesieve/sessionthread.cpp:307
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Authentication failed.\n"
"Most likely the password is wrong.\n"
"The server responded:\n"
"%1"
msgstr ""
"Fallou a autenticación.\n"
"O máis posíbel e que o contrasinal fose incorrecto.\n"
"O servidor respostou:\n"
"%1"

#: kmanagesieve/sievejob.cpp:137 kmanagesieve/sievejob.cpp:142
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The script did not upload successfully.\n"
"This is probably due to errors in the script.\n"
"The server responded:\n"
"%1"
msgstr ""
"O script non se enviou satisfactoriamente.\n"
"Débese, probabelmente, a que contén erros.\n"
"O servidor respostou:\n"
"%1"

#: kmanagesieve/sievejob.cpp:146
msgid ""
"The script did not upload successfully.\n"
"The script may contain errors."
msgstr ""
"O script non se enviou satisfactoriamente.\n"
"O script pode contar erros."

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/autocreatescriptdialog.cpp:39
